Narrated by Hugh Ross, the story follows Adaline Bowman, a young woman who
stops aging following an accident at the age of twenty-nine.

15
01:13:02,608 --> 01:13:08,608
The film was produced by Sidney Kimmel
Entertainment and Lakeshore Entertainment.

16
01:17:54,782 --> 01:18:00,782
Principal photography took place in Vancouver from March 5 to May 5, 2014.

17
01:22:46,956 --> 01:22:52,956
It premiered in New York City on April 19, 2015, and was cinematically
released on April 24 in the United States by Lionsgate.

18
01:27:39,130 --> 01:27:45,130
It received mixed reviews from critics, though many praised both Lively's and Ford's
performances, citing them as some of their best work in recent years.

19
01:32:31,304 --> 01:32:37,304
A modest box-office success, it grossed $65.7 million
worldwide on a $25 million budget.

20
01:37:23,478 --> 01:37:29,478
The film received two nominations at the 42nd Saturn Awards, one for
Best Fantasy Film and one for Lively for Best Actress.

21
